%% alt: User input and retrieved content such as documents, tool results and emails pass through input guardrails, which run rules, then classifiers, then a model screen. Clean input goes to the model; input with sensitive data is masked first; harmful input is blocked or flagged, returning a safe response and going to a review queue and log.
flowchart TB
  U[User input]:::untrusted --> C
  D[Retrieved documents,<br/>tool results, emails]:::untrusted --> C
  C[Input guardrails<br/>rules → classifiers → model screen]:::control
  C -->|pass| M[Model]:::model
  C -->|mask| R[Redacted input]:::tool --> M
  C -->|block or flag| H[Safe response,<br/>review queue, log]:::tool
